{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/SeedRequest","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SeedRequest"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A game draws every random value — combat rolls, roaming actors, ","type":"text"},{"code":"oneOf","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prose — from one seeded stream (","type":"text"},{"code":"WorldState\/rngState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), so pinning the seed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes a whole session replay identically. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"play(_:_:seed:)"},{"text":" already does","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"that in the test suite; this is the same knob for a built binary, so a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transcript a tester records by hand becomes a reproducer someone else can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replay."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is also what the suite’s own "},{"code":"cachedWorld","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" falls back to for a ","type":"text"},{"code":"play","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"call that pins no seed, which is what makes ","type":"text"},{"code":"GNUSTO_SEED=7 swift test","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reproducible and a sweep across seeds able to find tests that only pass by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"luck. See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TestingYourGame","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text"